BusYatra User Flow:- 

┌─────────────────────┐
│   User Visit Site   │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           ↓
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Search Bus         │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           ↓
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Bus List           │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           ↓
      View Details
           ↓
   Is User Logged In?
      ↙           ↘
    NO             YES
     ↓              ↓
 Login Page     Bus Details
     ↓              ↓
 OTP Verify    Seat Selection
     ↓              ↓
 Redirect to   Booking Details
 Bus Details       ↓
                   ↓
              Payment
                   ↓
        ┌──────────┴──────────┐
        ↓                     ↓
   Payment Failed       Payment Success
        ↓                     ↓
  Try Again / Cancel    Generate Ticket
                              ↓
                      Save Ticket in Database
                              ↓
                       Generate E-Ticket
                              ↓
                       Send to User Email
                              ↓
                       Booking Completed


